/p></div><span class="tag">DEMO</span></div>`).join(''))}${panel('Data controls','Reset this browser demo',`<p class="muted" style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.6">Reset restores fictional seed data in this browser only. It does not modify any Supabase database.</p><button class="btn btn-danger" data-action="reset-demo">Reset demo data</button>`)}</div></div>`;
